50721303440_8574030010314542971_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8agOuWTcLjoQ7kNvwEKMzR-&_nc_oc=AdmCjXGNz-ww8DnGqK_7DpBnGgWvJQ9PoQwHSMQGSDXvsBVFGP32QdDSEHnuzB1ilT0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzVE1-dFAQ2y77tiAZch4UWvD82BwTBLVGf7WOm80L3sQ&oe=69AD6EFB"}, {"file_name": "Battle_Custom..._22.01.2025_14-23-01.png", "id": "622858333452979", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393399_622858336786312_1507184144715843708_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wBsN8DubL6IQ7kNvwHHEXWj&_nc_oc=AdnJrGHjyKIdFq_Ef6GtDqNVycr1fN0h94De9MH_yXRPZLKSaQ2OICaxQ0pVVr2OVMU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy3iWztscFZaQknjBw4XsnBJzal39H4Ba6HNzuPs57tjw&oe=69AD8794"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Screenshot 2024-07-15 at 11.38.32\u202fAM.png", "id": "1005971901065831", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75622012_1005971904399164_7972216345017916565_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LXAvFu773BEQ7kNvwF1HnlL&_nc_oc=Adl-JVusOHTLcrOGY4BEJeKcTr-Nc38J0NWFWlV0TW5Nat2FGpT_bhrOGMXZNbPd6Do&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy1ECEwU-5tcJyMvcu1yOxibdFsaZIOuZdNUkgJ2bEvUg&oe=69AD7563"}, "display_name": "Air Royale", "keywords": ["Royale", "Fight", "Gorilla", "Monkey", "Air"], "long_description": "Air Royale delivers exhilarating aerial combat, redefining the action genre. Players will soar through an open space, engaging in fast-paced fights that demand both skill and strategy. Intuitive controls and dynamic movement create an accessible yet deep gameplay experience, where mastering flight is just as crucial as aiming. A unique upgrading system adds a strategic layer to the action. Download Air Royale now!\n\n{1899114920663165}", "short_description": "Air Royale is an exhilarating multiplayer game designed for virtual reality. Step into a high-flying, action-packed world where players have fun